{"agent":"impl-ra-audit","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":3,"detail":"The new `--overrides` mode makes `gate list` return override rows (records with approver/level/kind), but the command still uses `render=L.gate_text`, which is written for gate rows with gate-specific fields such as `refuted`, `count`, `passes`, and `gates`. Given one recorded override, `ddflow gate list --overrides` passes those override rows through `L.gate_text`; the renderer will look for gate fields that do not exist on override rows and either raise a `KeyError`/`AttributeError` or emit malformed text, so the new read-only override view is broken at the declared surface layer.","digest":"4b8eb56e4b299feb","location":"ddflow/surfaces/declared/lifecycle.py `render=L.gate_text`","severity":"HIGH","title":"ddflow/surfaces/declared/lifecycle.py `render=L.gate_text`"}],"chunks_total":4,"coverage":"4/4 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":13767,"diff_sha":"c5a97e12e31158cb321eec50f1be283e856b68d82ac338f26967cb7e0cf0876f","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":1015.6,"excluded_bytes":2083,"excluded_files":2,"excluded_paths":["tests/golden/__snapshots__/test_golden_cli_help.ambr","tests/golden/__snapshots__/test_golden_mcp_tools.ambr"],"family":"deepseek","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","output_digest":"c436e48abe3b6b87","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/RA-audit-wire-2.critic.lan-deepseek-v4-pro.20261031T071030Z-cb850ef2.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2,3,4],"reviewed_head":"ca4241147f7f172bf5b957b5b8d5490090be69c3","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/gates.py":"100644 622ee2d78f5758353105253ea65775550d530033","ddflow/api/reporting/health.py":"100644 9c66d8fb4104e08933715576ff96f029e70f2163","ddflow/services/approvals/overrides.py":"10064